00:21:43,368 --> 00:21:45,491
That means more repairs per day and

605
00:21:45,491 --> 00:21:46,584
happier customers.

606
00:21:46,934 --> 00:21:47,967
Getting started.

607
00:21:48,147 --> 00:21:51,176
Technicians often train at trade schools or

608
00:21:51,176 --> 00:21:54,275
with manufacturers, then build a client base

609
00:21:54,275 --> 00:21:56,530
among homeowners and businesses.

