656
00:23:44,438 --> 00:23:46,464
The lesson: move toward judgment,

657
00:23:46,464 --> 00:23:48,734
relationships and the physical world.

658
00:23:49,084 --> 00:23:50,314
Let's get practical.

659
00:23:50,494 --> 00:23:52,920
Here's a simple AI toolkit almost any

660
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:54,756
hands on business could use,

661
00:23:54,756 --> 00:23:56,067
starting this month.

662
00:23:56,417 --> 00:23:57,137
Tool one.

663
00:23:57,317 --> 00:23:59,658
An AI phone and text assistant that

664
00:23:59,658 --> 00:24:00,995
answers after hours,

665
