now become appointments.

713
00:25:35,574 --> 00:25:38,056
Without hiring another office person,

714
00:25:38,056 --> 00:25:40,137
he adds dozens of jobs a month.

715
00:25:40,487 --> 00:25:42,873
Second, a salon owner who uses AI

716
00:25:42,873 --> 00:25:46,054
to fill last minute cancellations by texting

717
00:25:46,054 --> 00:25:48,512
clients on a waitlist and to write

718
00:25:48,512 --> 00:25:50,680
social media posts in minutes.

719
00:25:50,860 --> 00:25:52,921
Her stylists' chairs are fuller,

720
00:25:52,921 --> 00:25:55,046
and she saves hours every week on

721
00:25:55,046 --> 00:25:55,690
marketing.

