736
00:26:26,414 --> 00:26:27,824
will win customers.

737
00:26:28,004 --> 00:26:29,165
Mistake two.

738
00:26:29,345 --> 00:26:30,819
Trusting AI blindly.

739
00:26:30,999 --> 00:26:32,791
AI tools make mistakes,

740
00:26:32,791 --> 00:26:34,505
