741
00:26:34,685 --> 00:26:36,245
Always review estimates,

742
00:26:36,245 --> 00:26:39,364
messages and advice before they reach customers.

743
00:26:39,714 --> 00:26:40,805
Mistake three.

744
00:26:40,985 --> 00:26:43,557
Replacing the human touch where customers want

745
00:26:43,557 --> 00:26:43,725
