748
00:26:48,069 --> 00:26:48,700
not a bot.

749
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:50,188
Use AI for paperwork,

750
00:26:50,188 --> 00:26:52,305
not for moments that need empathy.

751
00:26:52,485 --> 00:26:53,692
And mistake four.

752
00:26:53,872 --> 00:26:57,719
Feeding sensitive customer information into tools without

753
00:26:57,719 --> 00:26:59,608
understanding privacy rules.

754
00:26:59,788 --> 00:27:03,539
Health, financial and children's information deserve extra

755
00:27:03,539 --> 00:27:03,863
care.

756
00:27:04,213 --> 00:27:05,954
Now, three angles.

757
00:27:06,134 --> 00:27:07,586
First, the numbers.

758
00:27:07,766 --> 00:27:09,574
How can AI make an AI proof

759
00:27:09,574 --> 00:27:11,249
business more profitable?

760
00:27:11,599 --> 00:27:12,562
An illustration.

761
00:27:12,742 --> 00:27:15,473
A service business with one million dollars

762
00:27:15,473 --> 00:27:17,949
in revenue and ten percent profit earns

763
00:27:17,949 --> 00:27:19,790
one hundred thousand dollars.

764
00:27:19,970 --> 00:27:22,392
Cut office costs by thirty thousand and

765
00:27:22,392 --> 00:27:24,876
add twenty thousand of profit from calls

766
00:27:24,876 --> 00:27:25,931
you used to miss,

767
00:27:25,931 --> 00:27:27,980
and profit can rise to around one

768
00:27:27,980 --> 00:27:29,409
hundred fifty thousand.

769
00:27:29,759 --> 00:27:31,651
Here's a simple illustration.

770
00:27:31,831 --> 00:27:34,485
A service company brings in one million

771
00:27:34,485 --> 00:27:36,935
dollars a year and keeps ten percent

772
00:27:36,935 --> 00:27:39,656
as profit, one hundred thousand dollars.

773
00:27:39,836 --> 00:27:42,699
Say AI tools reduce office and scheduling

774
00:27:42,699 --> 00:27:45,003
costs by thirty thousand dollars.

775
00:27:45,183 --> 00:27:47,118
And say answering every call,

776
00:27:47,118 --> 00:27:48,052
day and night,

777
00:27:48,052 --> 00:27:50,455
brings in extra jobs worth enough to

778
00:27:50,455 --> 00:27:53,391
add about twenty thousand dollars of profit.

779
00:27:53,571 --> 00:27:56,060
Profit rises from one hundred thousand to

780
00:27:56,060 --> 00:27:58,610
around one hundred fifty thousand dollars.

781
00:27:58,790 --> 00:28:00,990
That's a fifty percent jump in profit

782
00:28:00,990 --> 00:28:02,714
without a single extra truck.

783
00:28:03,064 --> 00:28:05,370
Why does such a small change matter

784
00:28:05,370 --> 00:28:05,897
