785
00:28:06,077 --> 00:28:09,258
Because service businesses often have thin margins.

786
00:28:09,438 --> 00:28:11,843
When profit is ten percent of revenue,

787
00:28:11,843 --> 00:28:14,059
every dollar saved or earned on top

788
00:28:14,059 --> 00:28:16,148
goes straight to the bottom line.

789
00:28:16,328 --> 00:28:19,191
A few percentage points of efficiency can

790
00:28:19,191 --> 00:28:21,216
transform the owner's income.

791
00:28:21,566 --> 00:28:23,963
And higher profit raises the value of

792
00:28:23,963 --> 00:28:24,805
the business.

793
00:28:24,985 --> 00:28:27,192
If a business sells for three times

794
00:28:27,192 --> 00:28:29,966
its profit, raising profit by fifty thousand

795
00:28:29,966 --> 00:28:32,614
dollars could add around one hundred fifty

796
00:28:32,614 --> 00:28:34,505
thousand dollars to its value.

797
00:28:34,685 --> 00:28:36,384
AI tools, used well,

798
00:28:36,384 --> 00:28:39,357
can make an AI proof business worth

799
00:28:39,357 --> 00:28:39,782
more.

800
00:28:40,132 --> 00:28:42,628
Of course, these are illustrations.

801
00:28:42,808 --> 00:28:44,165
AI tools cost money,

802
00:28:44,165 --> 00:28:45,522
take time to set up,

803
00:28:45,522 --> 00:28:48,439
and don't always deliver what they promise.

804
00:28:48,619 --> 00:28:50,904
Start with one tool that solves one

805
00:28:50,904 --> 00:28:53,973
clear problem, like missed calls or scheduling,

806
00:28:53,973 --> 00:28:56,781
and measure the results before adding more.

807
00:28:57,131 --> 00:28:58,907
There's also a labor angle.

808
00:28:59,087 --> 00:29:01,720
Many of these industries struggle to find

809
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:03,197
enough skilled workers.

810
00:29:03,377 --> 00:29:04,950
AI won't swing a hammer,

811
00:29:04,950 --> 00:29:07,048
but it can make each worker more

812
00:29:07,048 --> 00:29:09,605
productive by cutting the time spent on

813
00:29:09,605 --> 00:29:12,358
driving, paperwork and back and forth with

814
00:29:12,358 --> 00:29:13,013
customers.

815
00:29:13,193 --> 00:29:16,028
If each technician completes one extra job

816
00:29:16,028 --> 00:29:18,525
per week thanks to better scheduling,

817
00:29:18,525 --> 00:29:20,685
that adds up to fifty extra jobs

818
00:29:20,685 --> 00:29:21,899
a year per person,

819
00:29:21,899 --> 00:29:23,654
without hiring anyone new.

820
00:29:24,004 --> 00:29:27,015
Finally, compare the two kinds of businesses

821
00:29:27,015 --> 00:29:27,905
side by side.

822
00:29:28,085 --> 00:29:31,013
An information business exposed to AI may

823
00:29:31,013 --> 00:29:33,656
