824
00:29:33,656 --> 00:29:35,585
to work faster and cheaper.

825
00:29:35,765 --> 00:29:38,024
A hands on business protected from AI

826
00:29:38,024 --> 00:29:39,916
can use the same tools to lower

827
00:29:39,916 --> 00:29:42,297
its costs while its prices hold steady,

828
00:29:42,297 --> 00:29:44,983
because customers still need the human work.

829
00:29:45,163 --> 00:29:48,082
Falling costs and steady prices is exactly

830
00:29:48,082 --> 00:29:50,446
the combination that grows profit.

831
00:29:50,796 --> 00:29:51,643
Second angle.

832
00:29:51,823 --> 00:29:52,926
The psychology.

833
00:29:53,106 --> 00:29:55,266
How does fear of AI affect people's

834
00:29:55,266 --> 00:29:56,253
money decisions?

835
00:29:56,603 --> 00:29:58,669
The first effect is paralysis.

836
00:29:58,849 --> 00:30:01,032
Some people are so worried about AI

837
00:30:01,032 --> 00:30:03,028
that they don't start or buy any

838
00:30:03,028 --> 00:30:05,397
business, waiting to see what happens.

839
00:30:05,577 --> 00:30:07,162
But waiting has a cost:

840
00:30:07,162 --> 00:30:09,711
years of income and ownership missed.

841
00:30:09,891 --> 00:30:11,834
The businesses on this list are among

842
00:30:11,834 --> 00:30:13,199
the safest bets available.

843
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:15,655
The second effect is a herd moving

844
00:30:15,655 --> 00:30:16,522
the wrong way.

845
00:30:16,702 --> 00:30:19,490
Many young people are being pushed toward

846
00:30:19,490 --> 00:30:21,191
