849
00:30:24,183 --> 00:30:26,768
while fewer enter the trades and hands

850
00:30:26,768 --> 00:30:27,720
on businesses.

851
00:30:27,900 --> 00:30:30,185
That imbalance may raise the value of

852
00:30:30,185 --> 00:30:31,174
hands on skills.

853
00:30:31,524 --> 00:30:34,902
The third effect is overconfidence in technology.

854
00:30:35,082 --> 00:30:37,529
Some people assume robots will soon do

855
00:30:37,529 --> 00:30:40,748
everything, so nothing physical is worth building.

